---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="prose-body">
      <p>I'm <strong>Dash</strong>, a British artist and maker based in Singapore.</p>
      <p>
        I discovered underground electronic music as a teenager. Listening led to DJing, DJing led to
        producing, and producing made me want to know how the equipment actually worked. That's partly
        how I ended up studying engineering at university. Along the way I built amplifiers, a
        synthesiser, a stereo compressor and some modular gear, most of which worked.
      </p>
      <p>
        I then spent nearly twenty years at Google, mostly in partnerships across Europe and Asia. I
        helped products like Maps and Android reach a lot of people, and I learned a great deal about
        getting ambitious things done with other people. Music and making carried on at the edges,
        usually late at night.
      </p>
      <p>
        These days they're closer to the centre. I design and 3D print light sculptures, write code,
        and experiment with microcontrollers and TouchDesigner. I'm interested in how sound, light and
        movement can respond to the people in a space, and especially to several people at once.
      </p>
      <p>This site is where I keep the work, finished or otherwise.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
